yrDSYPThu54Bubu2CAxnwn2d7KMHuvd-Xoy8x9HN3wkz-g1vNx_n6vq2mo4olKL4lo_DA), [3](https://www.google.com/goto?url=CAESeQHrOzAVj5UIx6k3Ja77JdBpbsnu7ukNOeDgFucC_vNG1XH_NBIKfBj_GDQNJm4LV1oQ34JMli6VMyR-kZxw-t10bS-VjrpxE1h-3fl0wqIB-ztBJDxGJmvYsOU-p8cxLfeGpWfg8EyuZVl1vWoohASF9pzGcZNW60Y)]

Core Specifications

- **Microcontroller:** ESP32 dual-core Xtensa 32-bit LX6, running up to 240 MHz (up to 600 DMIPS) [[1](https://www.google.com/goto?url=CAESeAHrOzAVuKaaqtokR5wE-TxcHeQeCRyitGZxKAcaQ2yP6gUBj93sbco5cXsG57mYb5Z1kyQ5MKq76CBvvxCsveznfwCWmyrDSYPThu54Bubu2CAxnwn2d7KMHuvd-Xoy8x9HN3wkz-g1vNx_n6vq2mo4olKL4lo_DA)]
- **Memory:** 4 MB SPI Flash, 520 KB SRAM, 448 KB ROM [[1](https://www.google.com/goto?url=CAESeAHrOzAVuKaaqtokR5wE-TxcHeQeCRyitGZxKAcaQ2yP6gUBj93sbco5cXsG57mYb5Z1kyQ5MKq76CBvvxCsveznfwCWmyrDSYPThu54Bubu2CAxnwn2d7KMHuvd-Xoy8x9HN3wkz-g1vNx_n6vq2mo4olKL4lo_DA)]
- **Wireless:** Wi-Fi 802.11 b/g/n (2.4 GHz) and Bluetooth v4.2 BR/EDR & BLE [[1](https://www.google.com/goto?url=CAESeAHrOzAVuKaaqtokR5wE-TxcHeQeCRyitGZxKAcaQ2yP6gUBj93sbco5cXsG57mYb5Z1kyQ5MKq76CBvvxCsveznfwCWmyrDSYPThu54Bubu2CAxnwn2d7KMHuvd-Xoy8x9HN3wkz-g1vNx_n6vq2mo4olKL4lo_DA)]
- **Operating Voltage:** 5V via USB/external (Logic/GPIO level is 3.3V) [[1](https://www.google.com/goto?url=CAESeAHrOzAVuKaaqtokR5wE-TxcHeQeCRyitGZxKAcaQ2yP6gUBj93sbco5cXsG57mYb5Z1kyQ5MKq76CBvvxCsveznfwCWmyrDSYPThu54Bubu2CAxnwn2d7KMHuvd-Xoy8x9HN3wkz-g1vNx_n6vq2mo4olKL4lo_DA)]
- **USB Interface:** Typically uses CH340G, CH340C, or CH9102X serial-to-USB chips depending on the specific variant. [[1](https://www.google.com/goto?url=CAESeQHrOzAVR69LovMySE9EmzmK3Rrzp8WVJYua7Cw3jhnC_UzU2OwNyOWgykzuH_LE1zHfBm9mixB1tUnao_Km87FCOvXrl7-vWn69P4pu88Bos6_d0QoeYHpSU7MRwF9XB2cvkS9mEbJNRTftzTeKmaTMAYRP4OZX3cA), [2](https://www.google.com/goto?url=CAESYgHrOzAVireB-Zh3h7Dm7iUClnSFfJUVyshcxh9kQfferUiPpWxwZb9KStjBY98_rULut1oIGM7CApIls-I4BXvrN68YIPmx0Omt-uip-aENiaGnV6Tkf3-e9p75BWLRSuJ6), [3](https://www.google.com/goto?url=CAESeAHrOzAVuKaaqtokR5wE-TxcHeQeCRyitGZxKAcaQ2yP6gUBj93sbco5cXsG57mYb5Z1kyQ5MKq76CBvvxCsveznfwCWmyrDSYPThu54Bubu2CAxnwn2d7KMHuvd-Xoy8x9HN3wkz-g1vNx_n6vq2mo4olKL4lo_DA)]

